sequenceDiagram
    participant Orc as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant Istio as Istio Sidecar<br/>(mTLS + Auth)
    participant BI as built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as huggingface Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Judge as llm_judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant S3 as S3/MinIO<br/>9000/TCP
    participant VLLM as vLLM Server<br/>HTTP

    note over Orc,VLLM: Flow 1: Content Analysis (built-in)
    Orc->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Platform Auth
    Istio->>BI: Forward (mTLS)<br/>Service Identity
    BI->>BI: Run regex/file-type/custom detectors
    BI-->>Istio: Detection results (JSON)
    Istio-->>Orc: Response

    note over Orc,VLLM: Flow 2: Content Analysis (HuggingFace ML)
    Orc->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Platform Auth
    Istio->>HF: Forward (mTLS)<br/>Service Identity
    HF->>S3: Load model weights<br/>AWS S3 credentials<br/>(startup / on-demand)
    S3-->>HF: Model artifacts<br/>(/mnt/models)
    HF->>HF: Run ML inference<br/>(SeqClass / TokClass / CausalLM)
    HF-->>Istio: Classification results (JSON)
    Istio-->>Orc: Response

    note over Orc,VLLM: Flow 3: LLM Judge Evaluation
    Orc->>Istio: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Platform Auth
    Istio->>Judge: Forward (mTLS)<br/>Service Identity
    Judge->>VLLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Judge prompt with metric
    VLLM-->>Judge: LLM evaluation response
    Judge->>Judge: Parse verdict<br/>(safety, toxicity, etc.)
    Judge-->>Istio: Evaluation results (JSON)
    Istio-->>Orc: Response

    note over Orc,VLLM: Prometheus Scrape
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    Prom->>BI: GET /metrics (8080/TCP)
    BI-->>Prom: Counters: detections, requests, errors, runtime
    Prom->>HF: GET /metrics (8000/TCP)
    HF-->>Prom: Counters: detections, requests, errors, runtime
